<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Kmart cut to outperform.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Kmart cut to outperform.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley said it lowered its recommendation on Kmart Corp to outperform from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- shares fell 3/4 to 10-3/4 in early NYSE trade.</p>
<p>-- additional details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
